---
layout: base.njk
description: Practical writing on Microsoft Fabric, Spark, Python and modern data platforms.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> Data architect · Speaker · Builder</div>
    <h1>Complex data systems,<br><em>made legible.</em></h1>
    <p>Practical notes from building with Microsoft Fabric, Spark, Python and the modern data stack—without hiding the sharp edges.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/posts/">Read the notes <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a class="button" href="/presentations/">Explore talks</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% set topics = collections.posts | topicCounts %}
  {% set allTopics = collections.posts | allTags %}
  <div class="signal-card">
    <div class="signal-top"><span>FIELD NOTES / TOPICS</span><span class="live">{{ collections.posts | length }} POSTS</span></div>
    <div class="signal-visual" aria-label="Top blog topics by number of posts">
      {% for topic in topics %}
      <a class="topic-column" href="/tags/#{{ topic.name | slug }}" title="{{ topic.name }}: {{ topic.count }} posts">
        <strong>{{ topic.count }}</strong>
        <span class="topic-bar" style="--h:{{ topic.percentage }}%"></span>
        <small>{{ topic.name }}</small>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <dl>
      <div><dt>Most covered</dt><dd>{{ topics[0].name }} · {{ topics[1].name }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Published</dt><dd>{{ collections.posts | length }} field notes</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Topic index</dt><dd>{{ allTopics | length }} tags</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-heading">
  <div><span class="section-number">01</span><h2>Latest writing</h2></div>
  <a href="/tags/">Browse by tag →</a>
</section>
{% set posts = collections.posts %}
{% include "post-list.njk" %}

<section class="split-callout">
  <div><span class="section-number">02 / SPEAKING</span><h2>Slides that work<br>beyond the stage.</h2></div>
  <div>
    <p>Interactive Slidev decks on Spark performance, data engineering and the tools that make hard systems easier to reason about.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/presentations/">View presentations <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
